-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/11 (22.6.2025): תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל לשנת הלימודים תשפ"ה
-- The recuperation allowance for school year תשפ"ה under the 2025 law that
-- freezes and reduces it, the limits on position size, and the jubilee grant.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT vocabulary

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"ה
-- (common.l4: September 2024 = 1, June 2025 = 10).

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the caps on the
-- position across all employers (140% off the reforms, 125% or 130% under Oz
-- LaTmura, 117% under Ofek Hadash, 150% for a principal) restate the
-- agreements' limits on employment beyond a full position. A cap takes away
-- no rest and adds no hour; the weeks the agreements allow beyond a full
-- position are weighed where they set them (the takanon's §1.24, the base
-- agreement's §33, the Oz agreement's §14).

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘בעל’ is holding or having (‘בעל ותק’), not a
-- husband; none gives pay or other remuneration by sex.

§ `תשפ"ה/11 תשלום דמי הבראה ומענק יובל`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (22.6.2025), reference number, addressee and subject line; no rule.

§§ `1 קצובת דמי הבראה`

-- akn:art_1__para_a A recital: the 2025 law freezing and reducing the recuperation pay was published on 27.3.2025 and the circular's instructions follow from it.

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשפ"ה, as far as this circular's recuperation and jubilee rules ask about it.
DECLARE `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` HAS
    `seniority in teaching`                    IS A NUMBER  @desc years of seniority in teaching, the year being served counted (first year = 1), for the recuperation days table
    `position fraction at this employer`       IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held at this employer this school year (1 = one full position)
    `months of work`                           IS A NUMBER  @desc months of work this school year (1.ח: 1/10 for each month of work)
    `monthly employee`                         IS A BOOLEAN @desc the employee is a monthly employee (עובד חודשי)

§§§ `1.ג The value of a recuperation day`

@ref akn:art_1__para_c
`the value of a recuperation day in תשפ"ה` MEANS 471.4

-- The circular says the value is unchanged from תשפ"ד; it states only the
-- value, and the earlier year's circular is not imported here.

§§§ `1.ז The recuperation days table`

@ref akn:art_1__para_g/t1
DECLARE `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` HAS
    `band from year`        IS A NUMBER
    `band to year`          IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה", with no upper bound
    `days in the band`      IS A NUMBER
    `days after reduction`  IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_1__para_g akn:art_1__para_g/t1
`the recuperation days table of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS
    LIST `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` 1  3   7  6,
         `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` 4  10  9  8,
         `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` 11 15  10 9,
         `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` 16 19  11 10,
         `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` 20 24  12 11,
         `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11` 25 999 13 12

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `recuperation band of circular תשפ"ה/11`
DECIDE `the bands for seniority` n IS
    filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `band from year` AND n AT MOST b's `band to year`)
           `the recuperation days table of circular תשפ"ה/11`

-- The table is a function: every year from 1 to 40 has exactly one row.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the bands for seniority` n) EQUALS 1) (range 1 40)

-- 1.ב: the reduction is one day for a full year at a full position; the
-- table's third column is its second less one, row by row.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN b YIELD b's `days after reduction` EQUALS b's `days in the band` MINUS 1)
            `the recuperation days table of circular תשפ"ה/11`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation days before the reduction` n IS
    sum (map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `days in the band`) (`the bands for seniority` n))

§§§ `1.ח–1.י Part-time, more than one position, more than one employer`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-a: the parenthesis counts 1/10 for each month of
-- work, so a year of more than ten months of work would pass the whole
-- allowance. The reading adopted: the share is capped at the whole.
@ref akn:art_1__para_h
GIVEN y IS AN `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months share of circular תשפ"ה/11` y IS
    min (y's `months of work` DIVIDED BY 10) 1

`1/10 for each month uncapped passes the whole allowance in a twelve-month year` MEANS
    12 DIVIDED BY 10 GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `1/10 for each month uncapped passes the whole allowance in a twelve-month year`

-- 1.ט: at one employer, no more than one full position counts. 1.י: with
-- more than one employer, each pays on the position held with it, even
-- where the total passes 100%; so the cap is per employer.
@ref akn:art_1__para_i akn:art_1__para_j
GIVEN y IS AN `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position share at this employer of circular תשפ"ה/11` y IS
    min (y's `position fraction at this employer`) 1

§§§ `1.ב, 1.ד The reduction of one recuperation day`

-- 1.ב: a monthly employee at a full position for the whole year loses one
-- day; 1.ד: part-time or part of the year, the day is reduced in proportion.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_d
GIVEN y IS AN `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days reduced` y IS
    IF y's `monthly employee`
    THEN `months share of circular תשפ"ה/11` y TIMES `position share at this employer of circular תשפ"ה/11` y
    ELSE 0

-- 1.ו: the percentage reduction of the 2025-2026 fiscal-stabilisation law
-- does not apply to the recuperation allowance (an excluded component
-- under its section 1(1)(ב)).
@ref akn:art_1__para_f
`the fiscal-stabilisation percentage reduction applies to the recuperation allowance` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:art_1__para_e Draws the employers' attention to the law's own instructions (its section 4(3) and (4)), which the circular does not restate.
-- akn:art_1__para_e/p2 A link to the law; no rule.

§§§ `1 The recuperation allowance, assembled`

-- The days of the table (1.ז), by the share of the year (1.ח) and of the
-- position (1.ט–1.י), less the reduced day (1.ב, 1.ד), at the day's value
-- (1.ג).
@export The recuperation allowance a teaching employee is paid by one employer for school year תשפ"ה under circular תשפ"ה/11, after the one-day reduction of the 2025 law
GIVEN y IS AN `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` @desc the employee's school year at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` y IS
    (`recuperation days before the reduction` (y's `seniority in teaching`)
        TIMES `months share of circular תשפ"ה/11` y
        TIMES `position share at this employer of circular תשפ"ה/11` y
        MINUS `days reduced` y)
    TIMES `the value of a recuperation day in תשפ"ה`

§§§ `1.יא–1.יב Limits on the size of the position`

-- The total position, across all employers, beyond which employment is
-- restricted; 1.יב's limits are subject to the exceptional-employment
-- procedure for תשפ"ה, which is an input.
@ref akn:art_1__para_ja akn:art_1__para_jb
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position limit across all employers` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teacher outside the reforms` THEN 1.4
    WHEN `a principal outside the reforms` THEN 1.5
    WHEN `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.315
    WHEN `a teacher in Ofek Hadash` THEN 1.17

-- akn:art_1__para_jb/p3 The file name of the exceptional-employment procedure (hrigot.pdf); the procedure itself is not in the corpus.

DECLARE `tashpah-11 circular action` IS ONE OF
    `employ beyond the limits` HAS `position employed` IS A NUMBER
                                   `weekly hours employed` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the recuperation allowance` HAS `recuperation amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the jubilee grant` HAS `jubilee amount paid` IS A NUMBER

-- The closing paragraph of 1: nothing above permits employment beyond these
-- positions, nor beyond 42 hours. A position or hours beyond them is the
-- breach, unless the exceptional-employment procedure allows it (1.יב).
@ref akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1__para_jb/p2
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`, `allowed by the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpah-11 circular action`
DECIDE `no employment beyond the limits of circular תשפ"ה/11` t `allowed by the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `allowed by the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `employ beyond the limits` p h
               PROVIDED p GREATER THAN `the position limit across all employers` t
                        OR h GREATER THAN 42
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/11 §1: the circular is no permit to employ beyond the position limits or 42 hours"

-- The recuperation allowance is paid with June 2025's salary (1.ב).
@ref akn:art_1__para_b
GIVEN y IS AN `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpah-11 circular action`
DECIDE `recuperation paid with June's salary of circular תשפ"ה/11` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the recuperation allowance` a
          PROVIDED a AT LEAST `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` y
    WITHIN `month number` June
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/11 §1.ב: the recuperation allowance is paid with June 2025's salary"

§§ `2 תשלום מענק יובל`

@desc One part of the teacher's employment, by the stage of education it is in (2.ו.3).
DECLARE `employment part` HAS
    `part stage`     IS A `stage of education`
    `part fraction`  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position this part is

@desc The teacher's case for the jubilee grant of June 2025.
DECLARE `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` HAS
    `seniority fixed in September 2024`         IS A NUMBER  @desc the accumulated seniority fixed for the teacher in September of the year before the payment (2.ד), including military service and purchased unpaid-leave years
    `seniority completed by 1 June 2025`        IS A NUMBER  @desc whole years of accumulated teaching seniority completed by 1 June 2025, military service included: 2.ב's measure, which 2.ו.2's "years of work in Israel" are read as (F-2024-25_tashpah_11-f)
    `parts of the employment`                   IS A LIST OF `employment part`
    `share of the year employed`                IS A NUMBER  @desc the part of the year the teacher was employed (1 = the whole year)
    `determining salary for pension and severance` IS A NUMBER @desc the salary determining pension and severance pay, without once-a-year payments (2.ג)
    `jubilee already paid at this threshold`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc a jubilee grant was paid in an earlier year for completing the same threshold (F-2024-25_tashpah_11-h)

-- akn:art_2__para_f/p1 The heading "הבהרות"; its items are encoded below.

-- 2.ו.3: the seniority that entitles to the grant depends on the stage the
-- part of the employment is in.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f__subpara_3
GIVEN s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the entitling seniority` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `the junior-high stage` THEN 25
    WHEN `the upper-division stage` THEN 25
    WHEN `recognised unofficial special education in Ofek Hadash` THEN 25
    WHEN `the academic teachers' college stage` THEN 25
    OTHERWISE 30

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-e: the 25-year list names "המכללות האקדמאיות להכשרת
-- עו"ה" and the 30-year list "מכללות להכשרת עו"ה". An academic college for
-- training teaching staff is, in words, also a college for training them,
-- so read as a genus the 30-year list takes it too. The reading adopted:
-- the 30-year list's colleges are the colleges that are not academic.
GIVEN s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `named by the 25-year list` s IF
    `the entitling seniority` s EQUALS 25

GIVEN s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `named by the 30-year list read as a genus` s IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `the kindergarten stage` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the primary stage` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the teachers' college stage` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `the academic teachers' college stage` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`an academic teacher-training college is named by both lists` MEANS
        `named by the 25-year list` `the academic teachers' college stage`
    AND `named by the 30-year list read as a genus` `the academic teachers' college stage`
#ASSERT `an academic teacher-training college is named by both lists`

-- 2.ו.1: a year of unpaid leave for which pension rights were purchased
-- counts towards the seniority; it is part of the seniority inputs.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f__subpara_1
GIVEN `unpaid-leave year purchased for pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the unpaid-leave year counts towards the jubilee seniority` `unpaid-leave year purchased for pension` IF
    `unpaid-leave year purchased for pension`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-c: 2.ד measures the seniority as fixed in September
-- of the year before the payment, 2.ו.2 as completed by 1 June of the
-- year of payment. The reading adopted: 2.ו.2, the clarification that
-- names the day, decides.
-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-h: 2ב pays one "of 25 or 30 years and more", and read alone
-- pays again in every later year; 2ו.2 entitles one who completed the
-- threshold "that year". The reading adopted, as F-2021-22_tashpab_06-d's:
-- paid once, in the year the threshold is completed (the input
-- `jubilee already paid at this threshold`).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_d akn:art_2__para_f__subpara_2
GIVEN c IS A `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11`, p IS AN `employment part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the part entitles under 2.ו.2` c p IF
        c's `seniority completed by 1 June 2025` AT LEAST `the entitling seniority` (p's `part stage`)
    AND NOT c's `jubilee already paid at this threshold`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-f: 2ב counts accumulated seniority in teaching, military
-- service included, with the employers, the owners and in formal
-- education; 2ו(2) counts "years of work in Israel", compulsory IDF service
-- included. The reading adopted, as in every jubilee circular: 2ב's own
-- measure, which 2ו(3) calls accumulated seniority "כהגדרתו לעיל"; 2ו(2)'s
-- years are read as that seniority, completed by 1 June.
GIVEN `years in teaching` IS A NUMBER, s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the years 2ב counts in circular תשפ"ה/11` `years in teaching` s IF
    `years in teaching` AT LEAST `the entitling seniority` s

GIVEN `years in teaching` IS A NUMBER, `years of other work in Israel` IS A NUMBER, s IS A `stage of education`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the years 2ו(2) counts` `years in teaching` `years of other work in Israel` s IF
    `years in teaching` PLUS `years of other work in Israel` AT LEAST `the entitling seniority` s

`2ב and 2ו(2) count different years` MEANS
        `has the years 2ו(2) counts` 20 10 `the primary stage`
    AND (NOT `has the years 2ב counts in circular תשפ"ה/11` 20 `the primary stage`)
#ASSERT `2ב and 2ו(2) count different years`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-h's evidence: an upper-division teacher in her 27th year, paid the
-- grant at 25, has the years 2ב counts and her part does not entitle on
-- the reading adopted.
`an upper-division teacher in her 27th year, paid at 25 of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS
    `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` WITH
        `seniority fixed in September 2024`             IS 26
        `seniority completed by 1 June 2025`            IS 27
        `parts of the employment`                       IS LIST `employment part` `the upper-division stage` 1
        `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000
        `jubilee already paid at this threshold`        IS TRUE
`section 2ב of circular תשפ"ה/11 read alone pays the grant again in a later year` MEANS
        `has the years 2ב counts in circular תשפ"ה/11` 27 `the upper-division stage`
    AND (NOT `the part entitles under 2.ו.2` `an upper-division teacher in her 27th year, paid at 25 of circular תשפ"ה/11` (`employment part` `the upper-division stage` 1))
#ASSERT `section 2ב of circular תשפ"ה/11 read alone pays the grant again in a later year`

GIVEN c IS A `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11`, p IS AN `employment part`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the part entitles under 2.ד in circular תשפ"ה/11` c p IF
    c's `seniority fixed in September 2024` AT LEAST `the entitling seniority` (p's `part stage`)

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-d: 2.ב sends the 25/30 distinction to "סעיף ה.3";
-- 2.ה has no item 3, and the distinction is 2.ו.3.
DECLARE `paragraph of 2` IS ONE OF `2א`, `2ב`, `2ג`, `2ד`, `2ה`, `2ו`

GIVEN p IS A `paragraph of 2`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `numbered items in` p IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `2ו` THEN 5
    OTHERWISE 0

`2.ב points to an item 3 of 2.ה, which has no items` MEANS
    `numbered items in` `2ה` LESS THAN 3
#ASSERT `2.ב points to an item 3 of 2.ה, which has no items`

-- 2.ו.4: by the position held that year, up to one position, and by the
-- part of the year employed.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f__subpara_4
GIVEN c IS A `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `entitling position fraction of circular תשפ"ה/11` c IS
    min (sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `part fraction`)
                  (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `the part entitles under 2.ו.2` c p) (c's `parts of the employment`))))
        1

-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: The circular names the
-- determining salary for pension and severance only as the base of the
-- jubilee grant's 60%; it rules nothing on severance.

-- 2.ג: the grant is 60% of the salary that determines pension and
-- severance pay, once-a-year payments (clothing, recuperation) excluded;
-- the exclusion is in the input's definition.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
GIVEN `determining salary for pension and severance` IS A NUMBER @desc without once-a-year payments such as clothing and recuperation
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `60% of the determining salary` `determining salary for pension and severance` IS
    `the jubilee rate of circular תשפ"ה/11` TIMES `determining salary for pension and severance`

`the jubilee rate of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS 0.6

-- 2.ה: the fiscal-stabilisation law's percentage reduction applies to the
-- jubilee grant; its rate is the law's, not this circular's.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, reduction IS A NUMBER @desc the law's percentage reduction, as a fraction
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `after the fiscal-stabilisation reduction` amount reduction IS
    amount TIMES (1 MINUS reduction)

-- 2.ו.5: with more than one employer, the multi-employer rules of 1
-- apply with the necessary changes: each employer pays on its own part,
-- one position at most with each. F-2024-25_tashpah_11-b: the clause
-- cites them as "1ו' עד 1ח'", which hold no multi-employer rule.
@ref akn:art_2__para_f__subpara_5
GIVEN `position fraction with this employer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `jubilee position share with one of several employers` `position fraction with this employer` IS
    min `position fraction with this employer` 1

DECLARE `paragraph of 1` IS ONE OF `1א`, `1ב`, `1ג`, `1ד`, `1ה`, `1ו`, `1ז`, `1ח`, `1ט`, `1י`, `1יא`, `1יב`

GIVEN p IS A `paragraph of 1`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `states a multi-employer rule` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `1ט` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `1י` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`the paragraphs 2.ו.5 cites` MEANS LIST `1ו`, `1ז`, `1ח`

`2.ו.5 cites paragraphs that state no multi-employer rule` MEANS
    all (GIVEN p YIELD NOT `states a multi-employer rule` p) `the paragraphs 2.ו.5 cites`
#ASSERT `2.ו.5 cites paragraphs that state no multi-employer rule`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11`, reduction IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashpah-11 circular action`
DECIDE `jubilee grant paid with June's salary of circular תשפ"ה/11` c reduction IS
    IF `entitling position fraction of circular תשפ"ה/11` c GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `pay the jubilee grant` a
               PROVIDED a AT LEAST `jubilee grant` c reduction
         WITHIN `month number` June
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/11 §2.א: the jubilee grant is paid with June 2025's salary"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§§ `2 The jubilee grant, assembled`

-- 60% of the determining salary (2.ג), by the entitling position (2.ו.3,
-- 2.ו.4) and the share of the year employed (2.ו.4), less the
-- fiscal-stabilisation law's reduction (2.ה).
@export The jubilee grant (מענק יובל) one employer pays a teaching employee in June 2025 under circular תשפ"ה/11, given the fiscal-stabilisation reduction as a fraction
GIVEN c IS A `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` @desc the teacher's seniority, parts of the employment and determining salary
      reduction IS A NUMBER @desc the fiscal-stabilisation law's percentage reduction, as a fraction (0 for none)
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `jubilee grant` c reduction IS
    `after the fiscal-stabilisation reduction`
        (`60% of the determining salary` (c's `determining salary for pension and severance`)
            TIMES `entitling position fraction of circular תשפ"ה/11` c
            TIMES min (c's `share of the year employed`) 1)
        reduction

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, signatures and copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples. Seniority, positions and salaries are placeholders; the day
-- value of 471.4 and the table are the circular's.

`a full year, year 22 of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS
    `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` WITH
        `seniority in teaching`               IS 22
        `position fraction at this employer`  IS 1
        `months of work`                      IS 10
        `monthly employee`                    IS TRUE

-- 12 days less 1 = 11 days, at 471.4.
#ASSERT `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` `a full year, year 22 of circular תשפ"ה/11` EQUALS 11 TIMES 471.4

`half a position, year 2` MEANS
    `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` WITH
        `seniority in teaching`               IS 2
        `position fraction at this employer`  IS 0.5
        `months of work`                      IS 10
        `monthly employee`                    IS TRUE

-- 7 days at half a position less half a day = 3 days.
#ASSERT `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` `half a position, year 2` EQUALS 3 TIMES 471.4

-- 1.ט: a position of 1.3 at one employer counts as one.
`1.3 positions at one employer, year 30` MEANS
    `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` WITH
        `seniority in teaching`               IS 30
        `position fraction at this employer`  IS 1.3
        `months of work`                      IS 10
        `monthly employee`                    IS TRUE
#ASSERT `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` `1.3 positions at one employer, year 30` EQUALS 12 TIMES 471.4

#ASSERT NOT `the fiscal-stabilisation percentage reduction applies to the recuperation allowance`

`a mixed teacher with 27 years of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS
    `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` WITH
        `seniority fixed in September 2024`             IS 26
        `seniority completed by 1 June 2025`            IS 27
        `parts of the employment`                       IS LIST `employment part` `the upper-division stage` 0.6, `employment part` `the primary stage` 0.4
        `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000
        `jubilee already paid at this threshold`        IS FALSE

-- Only the upper-division part reaches its 25 years; the primary part needs 30.
#ASSERT `entitling position fraction of circular תשפ"ה/11` `a mixed teacher with 27 years of circular תשפ"ה/11` EQUALS 0.6
#ASSERT `jubilee grant` `a mixed teacher with 27 years of circular תשפ"ה/11` 0 EQUALS 3600

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-c: completed 25 years in March 2025, fixed at 24 in
-- September 2024: 2.ו.2 entitles, 2.ד does not.
`a teacher completing 25 years in March 2025` MEANS
    `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` WITH
        `seniority fixed in September 2024`             IS 24
        `seniority completed by 1 June 2025`            IS 25
        `parts of the employment`                       IS LIST `employment part` `the upper-division stage` 1
        `share of the year employed`                    IS 1
        `determining salary for pension and severance`  IS 10000
        `jubilee already paid at this threshold`        IS FALSE

`2.ד and 2.ו.2 disagree for a teacher completing 25 years after September` MEANS
    NOT (`the part entitles under 2.ד in circular תשפ"ה/11` `a teacher completing 25 years in March 2025` (`employment part` `the upper-division stage` 1)
         EQUALS `the part entitles under 2.ו.2` `a teacher completing 25 years in March 2025` (`employment part` `the upper-division stage` 1))
#ASSERT `2.ד and 2.ו.2 disagree for a teacher completing 25 years after September`

#TRACE `recuperation paid with June's salary of circular תשפ"ה/11` `a full year, year 22 of circular תשפ"ה/11` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the recuperation allowance` 5185.4 AT 10

#TRACE `jubilee grant paid with June's salary of circular תשפ"ה/11` `a mixed teacher with 27 years of circular תשפ"ה/11` 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the jubilee grant` 3600 AT 10

#TRACE `no employment beyond the limits of circular תשפ"ה/11` `a teacher in Ofek Hadash` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ beyond the limits` 1.2 40 AT 3

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_11-g: the limits clause gives a principal outside the reform
-- 150%, and the closing restatement lists 140% "without reform" with no
-- principal's figure. Reading adopted, as in F-2021-22_tashpab_06-b: the
-- limits clause governs, and the restatement repeats the teachers' limits;
-- the encoding above gives the principal 150%.
`the principal's limit in the limits clause` MEANS 1.5
`the limit the restatement gives one outside the reforms` MEANS 1.4
`the limits clause and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits` MEANS
    NOT (`the principal's limit in the limits clause` EQUALS `the limit the restatement gives one outside the reforms`)
#ASSERT `the limits clause and its restatement give a principal outside the reforms different limits`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over finite spaces: seniority 1 to 40 years; positions in
-- tenths from 0 to 1.5; 0 to 12 months of work; monthly or not; every terms
-- of employment; every stage; 20 to 35 years by 1 June; paid at this
-- threshold before or not; shares of the year in quarters; the
-- fiscal-stabilisation reduction of 0 or 3.307%.

`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`tenths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)
`every terms of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS LIST `a teacher outside the reforms`, `a principal outside the reforms`, `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation`, `a teacher in Ofek Hadash`
`every stage of circular תשפ"ה/11` MEANS LIST `the junior-high stage`, `the upper-division stage`, `recognised unofficial special education in Ofek Hadash`, `the academic teachers' college stage`, `the kindergarten stage`, `the primary stage`, `the teachers' college stage`

-- 1.ז's table over years 1 to 40: the days never fall with seniority and
-- run from 7 to 13.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    `recuperation days before the reduction` n AT MOST `recuperation days before the reduction` (n PLUS 1)
                AND `recuperation days before the reduction` n AT LEAST 7
                AND `recuperation days before the reduction` n AT MOST 13)
            (range 1 40)

-- §1 over seniority, position, months and kind of employee: the allowance
-- is ₪471.4 times the table's days less the one day reduced from a monthly
-- employee, both by the position up to one and the months at a tenth each
-- up to ten (finding a's reading); never negative, and never falling with
-- more seniority, position or months.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                        all (GIVEN m YIELD
                                all (GIVEN mo YIELD
                                        LET y MEANS `employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` n f m mo
                                            a MEANS `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` y
                                        IN      a EQUALS 471.4 TIMES (`recuperation days before the reduction` n MINUS (IF mo THEN 1 ELSE 0)) TIMES min f 1 TIMES min (m DIVIDED BY 10) 1
                                            AND a AT LEAST 0
                                            AND a AT MOST `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` (`employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` (n PLUS 1) f m mo)
                                            AND a AT MOST `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` (`employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` n (f PLUS 0.1) m mo)
                                            AND a AT MOST `recuperation allowance for תשפ"ה` (`employee year of circular תשפ"ה/11` n f (m PLUS 1) mo))
                                    `both booleans`)
                            (range 0 12))
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            (range 1 40)

-- 1.יא over every terms: every limit allows a full position, the
-- principal's 150% is the highest (finding g).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                    `the position limit across all employers` t AT LEAST 1
                AND `the position limit across all employers` t AT MOST `the position limit across all employers` `a principal outside the reforms`)
            `every terms of circular תשפ"ה/11`

-- §2 over every stage, years by 1 June, earlier payment, position, share
-- and reduction: the grant is something exactly from the stage's threshold
-- (25 or 30) and never twice at the same threshold (finding h's reading);
-- it is 60% of the determining salary times the position up to one times
-- the share of the year, less the reduction; it never falls with a larger
-- position or share.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN s YIELD
                all (GIVEN y YIELD
                        all (GIVEN paid YIELD
                                all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN q YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN r YIELD
                                                        LET c  MEANS `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` (y MINUS 1) y (LIST `employment part` s f) (q DIVIDED BY 4) 10000 paid
                                                            c2 MEANS `jubilee case of circular תשפ"ה/11` (y MINUS 1) y (LIST `employment part` s (f PLUS 0.1)) (q DIVIDED BY 4) 10000 paid
                                                            k  MEANS (y AT LEAST `the entitling seniority` s) AND NOT paid
                                                            g  MEANS `jubilee grant` c r
                                                        IN      g EQUALS (IF k THEN 6000 TIMES min f 1 TIMES (q DIVIDED BY 4) TIMES (1 MINUS r) ELSE 0)
                                                            AND elem (`the entitling seniority` s) (LIST 25, 30)
                                                            AND g AT MOST `jubilee grant` c2 r)
                                                    (LIST 0, 3.307%))
                                            (range 0 4))
                                    `tenths to 1.5`)
                            `both booleans`)
                    (range 20 35))
            `every stage of circular תשפ"ה/11`
